<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen#Leermiddel> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Any tool that is used to support the learning process, achieve goals and thus impart knowledge, skills and attitudes."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://schema.org/CreativeWork>;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "This definition is a specification based on the definition of the Quality Alliance, i.e.: The umbrella term for both paper and digital products, whether in combination or not, regardless of who develops them: teachers, non-commercial and commercial providers."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/KandidaatStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen#Doel> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Description of what a learner needs to know, be able to do or what attitude they should have after completing a learning activity or training."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/KandidaatStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen#LeermiddelVerzameling> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Collection of Educational Resources with the same characteristics."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen#Leermiddel>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/KandidaatStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen#naam> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen#Competentie>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The designation or title that identifies a Learning Resource."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/KandidaatStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen#benodigdMateriaal> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen#Leermiddel>;
