    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A unique designation used to distinguish the Purpose."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/KandidaatStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen#toegankelijkheid> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen#Leermiddel>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The extent to which a Learning Tool is useful for individuals with different needs or limitations."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/KandidaatStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen#interactieType> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen#Leermiddel>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The nature of the mutual action or communication between user and system."@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "This can be interactive or non-interactive, for example."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/KandidaatStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen#Doel.competentie> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen#Doel>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen#Competentie>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A specific set of knowledge, skills and attitudes that must be mastered by a learner."@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "In this context, it concerns key competences, scientific domains and professional qualifications."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/KandidaatStandaard>.
<https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen#instructieTaal> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/leermiddelen>;
